  <data key="d7">{"finding": "1D_CNN Trial #1: Catastrophic overfitting with 4-layer/64-filter/128-dense architecture on SERS_spectral_v1. Train accuracy 97.8% vs test accuracy 20.4% (77.4pp gap). Root cause: 1.27M parameters (12.7x over target budget). Model memorized training data but failed completely on generalization. Early stopping at 18 epochs due to validation loss explosion. Parameter count breakdown suggests dense layer and filter width explosion. CRITICAL: Must maintain &lt;150K parameters for SERS data to prevent overfitting.", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN", "_data_source": "data_paper_mine_csv", "_manifest_name": "SERS_spectral_v1", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 256, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "info": "SERS bacterial classification dataset - E.coli, Enterococcus, Citrobacter. Optimized for spectral peak preservation with moderate frequency resolution."}}</data>
