  <data key="d7">{"finding": "Baseline trial of deep_slim_residual_d_cnn.py FAILED with 0.30 held-out accuracy due to hyperparameter misconfiguration, not architectural inadequacy. Critical issues: (1) Only 3 conv layers vs. &gt;5 required for deep-narrow architecture, (2) kernel_size=3 vs. memory-proven kernel_size=7, (3) LR=0.001 at convergence failure ceiling, (4) Early termination at epoch 20 indicates training instability. Architecture is structurally sound with residual connections + GAP - failure was calibration, not design. Next: Systematic Optuna sweep with depth 5-7, filters 48-64, kernel 5-7, LR 0.0001-0.0005.", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN", "_data_source": "data_paper_mine_csv", "_manifest_name": "SERS_standard_v1", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "1D_CNN"}}</data>
