  <data key="d7">{"finding": "**BREAKTHROUGH: spectral_attention_d_cnn.py achieves 93.43% held-out test accuracy with filters=80** - This represents a 3.28pp improvement over previous global best (90.15%). Key findings from 25-trial Optuna sweep: (1) filters=80 is the Pareto-optimal width, outperforming both narrower (64: 84.67%) and wider (96: 91.24%, 128: 89.05%) configurations; (2) The SE-block + dilated convolution + residual connection architecture eliminates overfitting (train-test gaps &lt; 5% vs 8.8% in baseline); (3) Inference time remains deployable at 21.75ms; (4) Parameter count scales to ~250K-400K range (vs original 102K), confirming capacity was the limiting factor. Best config: filters=80, num_conv_layers=6, kernel_size=7, dense_units=48, dropout=0.5, weight_decay=0.001, learning_rate=0.0001.", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN", "_data_source": "data_paper_mine_csv", "_manifest_name": "deep_1d_cnn_v6_optimized", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "1D_CNN"}}</data>
