  <data key="d7">{"tasks": ["1. **ANALYZE FAILED TRIAL**: Review trial results showing 33.69% accuracy, 13.25% overfitting gap, and near-zero learning speed (6.58e-18).", "2. **IMPLEMENT HYPOTHESIS 2**: Test optimizer and learning rate intervention to fix training stall - try AdamW with LR=0.001 and SGD with momentum.", "3. **CONTROL EXPERIMENT**: Keep architecture identical (8 layers, 64 filters, dropout=0.7, weight_decay=0.002) to isolate optimizer effect.", "4. **RUN OPTIMIZER COMPARISON**: Execute 2-3 trials with different optimizers/LR to find working configuration.", "5. **ANALYZE TRAINING DYNAMICS**: Check if learning speed improves and training loss decreases.", "6. **IF SUCCESSFUL**: Scale up with increased capacity (more layers/filters).", "7. **IF FAILS**: Move to Hypothesis 3 (residual architecture) or Hypothesis 1 (increased capacity)."], "_data_source": "data_paper_mine_csv", "_manifest_name": "SERS_standard_v1", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "1D_CNN"}}</data>
